From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] turnip: RFC single-sample sparse images on a740

Mesa !44876 (23bd860c, 2026-10-03) rebased onto the devel pin 7c130cb0 and
merged with 0011-tu-z-mutable-ubwc: the RFC's tu6_mutable_format_list_requires_linear()
is split into _reinterprets_r8g8_r16() and _has_swaps() so tu_image_init keeps
the TU_Z_MUTABLE gating; the sparse format query uses the combined check.
---
